        {
          "name": "Google",
          "description": "1. Send **Redirect** and open `data.url` in a browser.\n2. Approve, then copy the `code` query parameter from the URL Google redirects to.\n3. Paste it in the `googleCode` environment variable and send **Callback** within a few minutes (codes are single use).\n\nRequires GOOGLE_* values in api/.env. Docs: docs/api/authentication.md",
